  <entry>
    <title>C++ Lambda 表达式入门</title>
    <link href="/2026/02/03/lambda/"/>
    <url>/2026/02/03/lambda/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="什么是-Lambda-表达式"><a href="#什么是-Lambda-表达式" class="headerlink" title="什么是 Lambda 表达式"></a>什么是 Lambda 表达式</h2><p>Lambda 表达式是 C++11 引入的一个匿名函数特性。它允许我们在代码中直接定义一个小型的、一次性的函数，而无需单独命名。这使得代码更加简洁、灵活，特别是在需要传递函数对象作为参数的场景中。</p><h2 id="基本语法"><a href="#基本语法" class="headerlink" title="基本语法"></a>基本语法</h2><p>Lambda 表达式的基本语法结构如下：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp">[capture clause] (parameters) -&gt; return_type &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 函数体</span><br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>各部分的含义：</p><ul><li>**捕获子句 (capture clause)**：指定如何捕获外部变量</li><li>**参数列表 (parameters)**：函数的参数（与普通函数相同）</li><li>**返回类型 (return_type)**：可选，可由编译器自动推导</li><li><strong>函数体</strong>：Lambda 的实现代码</li></ul><h2 id="基本示例"><a href="#基本示例" class="headerlink" title="基本示例"></a>基本示例</h2><h3 id="最简单的-Lambda"><a href="#最简单的-Lambda" class="headerlink" title="最简单的 Lambda"></a>最简单的 Lambda</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> greet = []() &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, Lambda!&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">greet</span>();  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: Hello, Lambda!</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="带参数的-Lambda"><a href="#带参数的-Lambda" class="headerlink" title="带参数的 Lambda"></a>带参数的 Lambda</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> add = [](<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> a + b;<br>&#125;;<br><br>std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-built_in">add</span>(<span class="hljs-number">3</span>, <span class="hljs-number">5</span>) &lt;&lt; std::endl;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 8</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="明确返回类型的-Lambda"><a href="#明确返回类型的-Lambda" class="headerlink" title="明确返回类型的 Lambda"></a>明确返回类型的 Lambda</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> divide = [](<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b) -&gt; <span class="hljs-type">double</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">static_cast</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-type">double</span>&gt;(a) / b;<br>&#125;;<br><br>std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-built_in">divide</span>(<span class="hljs-number">5</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2</span>) &lt;&lt; std::endl;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 2.5</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="变量捕获"><a href="#变量捕获" class="headerlink" title="变量捕获"></a>变量捕获</h2><p>捕获子句控制 Lambda 如何访问外部作用域的变量：</p><h3 id="值捕获"><a href="#值捕获" class="headerlink" title="值捕获"></a>值捕获</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> x = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> printX = [x]() &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; x &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printX</span>();  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 10</span><br>x = <span class="hljs-number">20</span>;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">printX</span>();  <span class="hljs-comment">// 仍然输出: 10（捕获的是副本）</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="引用捕获"><a href="#引用捕获" class="headerlink" title="引用捕获"></a>引用捕获</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> x = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> updateX = [&amp;x]() &#123;<br>    x = <span class="hljs-number">20</span>;<br>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">updateX</span>();<br>std::cout &lt;&lt; x &lt;&lt; std::endl;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 20（原变量被修改）</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="混合捕获"><a href="#混合捕获" class="headerlink" title="混合捕获"></a>混合捕获</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, b = <span class="hljs-number">2</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> lambda = [a, &amp;b]() &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; a &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;, &quot;</span> &lt;&lt; b &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>    b = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 可以修改引用捕获的变量</span><br>&#125;;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="隐式捕获"><a href="#隐式捕获" class="headerlink" title="隐式捕获"></a>隐式捕获</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, b = <span class="hljs-number">2</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> lambda1 = [=]() &#123;     <span class="hljs-comment">// 按值捕获所有外部变量</span><br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; a + b &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> lambda2 = [&amp;]() &#123;     <span class="hljs-comment">// 按引用捕获所有外部变量</span><br>    a = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;<br>    b = <span class="hljs-number">20</span>;<br>&#125;;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="可变-Lambda（mutable）"><a href="#可变-Lambda（mutable）" class="headerlink" title="可变 Lambda（mutable）"></a>可变 Lambda（mutable）</h2><p>默认情况下，值捕获的变量在 Lambda 内部是 <code>const</code> 的。使用 <code>mutable</code> 关键字可以修改它们：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> count = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> increment = [count]() <span class="hljs-keyword">mutable</span> &#123;<br>    count++;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; count &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">increment</span>();  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 1</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">increment</span>();  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 2</span><br>std::cout &lt;&lt; count &lt;&lt; std::endl;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 0（外部变量不变）</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="实际应用场景"><a href="#实际应用场景" class="headerlink" title="实际应用场景"></a>实际应用场景</h2><h3 id="与-STL-算法配合使用"><a href="#与-STL-算法配合使用" class="headerlink" title="与 STL 算法配合使用"></a>与 STL 算法配合使用</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;vector&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span></span><br><br>std::vector&lt;<span class="hljs-type">int</span>&gt; nums = &#123;<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2</span>, <span class="hljs-number">3</span>, <span class="hljs-number">4</span>, <span class="hljs-number">5</span>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 查找第一个大于 3 的元素</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> it = std::<span class="hljs-built_in">find_if</span>(nums.<span class="hljs-built_in">begin</span>(), nums.<span class="hljs-built_in">end</span>(), [](<span class="hljs-type">int</span> x) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> x &gt; <span class="hljs-number">3</span>;<br>&#125;);<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (it != nums.<span class="hljs-built_in">end</span>()) &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Found: &quot;</span> &lt;&lt; *it &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 将所有元素乘以 2</span><br>std::for_each(nums.<span class="hljs-built_in">begin</span>(), nums.<span class="hljs-built_in">end</span>(), [](<span class="hljs-type">int</span>&amp; x) &#123;<br>    x *= <span class="hljs-number">2</span>;<br>&#125;);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="作为回调函数"><a href="#作为回调函数" class="headerlink" title="作为回调函数"></a>作为回调函数</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">process</span><span class="hljs-params">(std::function&lt;<span class="hljs-type">void</span>(<span class="hljs-type">int</span>)&gt; callback)</span> </span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; <span class="hljs-number">5</span>; i++) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">callback</span>(i);<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">process</span>([](<span class="hljs-type">int</span> x) &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Processing: &quot;</span> &lt;&lt; x &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="事件处理器（伪代码示例）"><a href="#事件处理器（伪代码示例）" class="headerlink" title="事件处理器（伪代码示例）"></a>事件处理器（伪代码示例）</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp">button.<span class="hljs-built_in">onClick</span>([](Event e) &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Button clicked!&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="泛型-Lambda（C-14）"><a href="#泛型-Lambda（C-14）" class="headerlink" title="泛型 Lambda（C++14）"></a>泛型 Lambda（C++14）</h2><p>C++14 引入了 <code>auto</code> 参数，使 Lambda 可以接受任意类型的参数：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> print = [](<span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> x) &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; x &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-number">42</span>);        <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 42</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-number">3.14</span>);      <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 3.14</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;hello&quot;</span>);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: hello</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="初始化捕获（C-17）"><a href="#初始化捕获（C-17）" class="headerlink" title="初始化捕获（C++17）"></a>初始化捕获（C++17）</h2><p>C++17 允许在捕获时创建新的变量：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> lambda = [x = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>]() &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; x &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 也可以移动捕获</span><br>std::unique_ptr&lt;<span class="hljs-type">int</span>&gt; ptr = std::<span class="hljs-built_in">make_unique</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-type">int</span>&gt;(<span class="hljs-number">42</span>);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> captureMove = [p = std::<span class="hljs-built_in">move</span>(ptr)]() &#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; *p &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>&#125;;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><p>Lambda 表达式是现代 C++ 中非常强大的特性，它让代码更加简洁和 expressive。主要优势包括：</p><ul><li><strong>简洁性</strong>：就地定义小型函数，无需单独命名</li><li><strong>灵活性</strong>：可以方便地捕获外部变量</li><li><strong>可读性</strong>：与 STL 算法配合使用时，代码意图更清晰</li><li><strong>性能</strong>：编译器通常能对 Lambda 进行良好的优化</li></ul><p>在函数式编程风格、回调、事件处理等场景中，Lambda 表达式都是不可或缺的工具。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
